  "question": {
    "text": "Let the focus <math><mi>S</mi></math> of the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></math> lie on the focal chord <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> of the same parabola. If the length&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;units, then the ratio of length&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> to the length of the latus rectum of the parabola is",
